# This directory holds the auto-exported OpenAPI spec (api.json).
#
# api.json is generated by `scripts/export_openapi.py` and consumed by
# `web/`'s `npm run gen:types` to produce `web/src/types/api.d.ts`.
#
# To bootstrap on a fresh checkout:
#     cd workspace
#     python scripts/export_openapi.py
#     cd web && npm run gen:types
